# Honesty and evaluation

Do not invent users, pilots, partners, market sizes, or accuracy figures.

The only published vision result is in `eval/EVAL.md` (11 openly licensed reference photos, 19 Nov 2026): top-1 6/11, expected label in top-1 or differential 11/11. Real field phone photos will likely score lower. Report misses; do not hide them.

Reproduce with `python eval/run_eval.py --api http://127.0.0.1:8080/api`.

Hackathon provenance fields may name xAI Grok models. Public marketing fields may not.
